# The page and config.js change with every deploy, and a device holding either
# looks like a site where the fix never landed. The edge answered
# CF-Cache-Status: HIT for these, and changing headers inside worker.js has no
# effect: Workers serve static assets from the edge before the Worker runs.
# This file is read by the assets layer itself, which is where the decision is
# made.
/
  Cache-Control: no-store

/config.js
  Cache-Control: no-store
